"This report discusses the technical capabilities of this Cyclops Blink malware variant and includes a list of more than 150 current and historical command-and-control (C&C) servers of the Cyclops Blink botnet. For every hard-coded TCP port used to communicate with the C&C servers, the malware creates a rule in Netfilter — the Linux kernel firewall — using the iptc_insert_entry() function from libiptc1 to allow output communication to it. C&C communication After obtaining data from the modules, the core component starts the encryption routines that will cipher the data before sending it to the C&C server. Targeted sectors: Chemical, Financial, Media, Mining, Technology. Delivery method(s): email.",APT28,gold,cyber,G0007,Turla,506cb3810ac6
"This report discusses the technical capabilities of this Cyclops Blink malware variant and includes a list of more than 150 current and historical command-and-control (C&C) servers of the Cyclops Blink botnet. For every hard-coded TCP port used to communicate with the C&C servers, the malware creates a rule in Netfilter — the Linux kernel firewall — using the iptc_insert_entry() function from libiptc1 to allow output communication to it. C&C communication After obtaining data from the modules, the core component starts the encryption routines that will cipher the data before sending it to the C&C server. Targeted sectors: Chemical, Financial, Media, Mining, Technology. Delivery method(s): email.",Turla,distractor,cyber,G0007,Turla,506cb3810ac6
"AES IV 0x14+L: AES encrypted data payload Figure 4: Structure of encrypted data To decrypt the data payload, the client decrypts the encrypted AES key using its randomly generated private key, then decrypts the data payload with the decrypted AES key. The command-and- control server has not responded with a payload for the third-stage even when phoning home from the assumed targeted region, which may signal that the campaign has been ended. The vulnerability (CVE-2018-5002) allows for a maliciously crafted Flash object to execute code on victim computers, which enables an attacker to execute a range of payloads and actions. Targeted sectors: Defense, Media. Delivery method(s): document.",APT28,gold,cyber,G0007,Turla,5b21351ad528
