"Finding portable executable As mentioned above, the main executable being dropped from the Excel Spreadsheet (vba_macro.exe) executes an additional two binaries that it creates: FONTCACHE.DAT and runndll32.exe, then it deletes the original executable (vba_ macro.exe). The file name is a GUID (globally unique identifier) format that is a unique reference number The binary gets executed by the following command from the startup menu lnk: rundll32.exe FONTCACHE.DAT #1. It executes iexplore.exe and will initiate communication with the C2 server. Targeted sectors: Energy, Government, Healthcare, Media, Transport, Utilities. Delivery method(s): document, macro. Tools/frameworks observed: cmd, rundll32.",Sandworm,gold,cyber,G0034,APT28,d6e4cc6ed741
